  "headline": "Banten Governor Andra Soni To Rebuild Burned Baduy Luar Homes",
  "seoTitle": "Andra Soni To Rebuild Burned Baduy Luar Homes",
  "metaDescription": "Banten Governor Andra Soni announced plans to rebuild 36 homes destroyed by fire in the Baduy Luar community following aid from the national government.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Banten Governor Andra Soni committed to rebuilding 36 homes for residents of Baduy Luar impacted by a recent major fire.",
    "Construction efforts are scheduled to commence in December 2026, adhering to traditional architectural standards requested by the community.",
    "National authorities, including the President, previously provided emergency aid consisting of 90 tons of rice and other essential supplies."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A significant fire recently impacted the Kampung Cipaler Girang area in Desa Kanekes, located within the Baduy Luar region. Reports indicate that at least 35 homes and several traditional rice barns were destroyed during the blaze. In response, local and national authorities have mobilized to provide immediate support to the affected residents. Banten Governor Andra Soni has instructed regional government departments to expedite recovery efforts and confirmed that 36 homes will be rebuilt starting in December 2026 to ensure the structures comply with local customs. Complementing the provincial response, the national government distributed 90 tons of rice and other emergency aid to assist families displaced by the incident. The provincial administration remains focused on long-term recovery and addressing the immediate housing and logistical needs of the community members who lost their property in the disaster.",
